# ATM-QA-U5-012 — docs/project-plan.md line count differs from develop baseline
#
# Investigation summary (2026-05-12):
# develop baseline: 3020 lines (b6506eff)
# All phase-U feature branches: 2920–2927 lines
# integrate/phase-U: 2920 lines
#
# The ~100-line reduction is fully accounted for by intentional editorial changes
# made in commit 5d7fa13 ("docs: finalize phase U planning and graft boundaries"):
#   1. Section 21 (Phase Q) condensed from ~272 lines to a 7-line historical stub (-265)
#   2. Section 25 (Phase S summary, 24 lines) removed — Phase S complete, detail in plan-phase-S.md (-24)
#   3. Section 26 (Phase T summary, 38 lines) removed — Phase T complete, detail in plan-phase-T.md (-38)
#   4. Section 25 replaced with Phase U Mailbox Simplification content (+235 lines)
# Net: -(265+24+38) + 235 ≈ -92 lines ≈ observed 100-line reduction
#
# plan-phase-S.md and plan-phase-T.md both exist on all feature branches confirming
# the removed summary sections were intentional editorial consolidation, not accidental loss.
# No pre-Phase-U content was accidentally dropped.

